---
description: Route-local UI stays local; global CSS/Tailwind order can break Homepage, Feed, and Chatroom
globs:
  - src/styles.css
  - src/styles/**/*.css
  - src/routes/__root.tsx
  - src/lib/app-surface-css.ts
  - src/components/app/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# CSS safety

- Fix route-local UI in that route’s component or a colocated stylesheet. Do not patch another route via global CSS.
- `src/styles.css` is guest-safe. `src/styles/app-surfaces.css` is for app surfaces (feed/chat/etc.).
- Guest `/` must **not** load `app-surfaces.css` to fix Feed/Chatroom. `shouldLoadAppSurfaceStyles("/")` stays `false`.
- If `styles.css`, `app-surfaces.css`, Tailwind `@source` / layer order, or shared theme changes: smoke `/`, `/feed`, and `/chatroom` on **desktop and mobile**.
- Prefer `src/lib/desktop-app-layout.test.ts` and `src/lib/guest-home-bundle.test.ts`.
